{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>以太空美學為主題的計時工具 NOVA，把裝置變成常亮顯示的環境時鐘，介面簡潔且沒有廣告，適合在工作、溫習或放鬆時需要專注節奏的使用者。它同時支援倒數計時與碼錶模式，並可自由更換背景。原價 US $0.99，現正於 App Store 限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>極簡單鍵操作與自訂預設</h2>\n<p>操作以單一按鈕為核心，點按即可開始、暫停與繼續，向右滑動則顯示停止選項。點一下預設可即時進入專注，長按可建立個人預設，軌道間隔以數字顯示於計時器下方。背景可選內置圖片或自己的相片，倒數計時與碼錶亦可自由切換，並可一鍵開關音效與震動。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-152-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-153-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-154-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-155-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-156-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-157-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：NOVA: Timer</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T01:29:22.900503+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}